4:Tbf6,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"Rescission Calendar & Deadline Calculator for Notaries","description":"A 3-business-day right-of-rescission calculator for loan signing agents, plus which loans actually qualify, how business days are counted under Regulation Z, and common mistakes.","mainEntityOfPage":"https://thebeardednotary.com/rescission-calendar-for-notaries","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Bearded Notary","url":"https://thebeardednotary.com"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Bearded Notary","url":"https://thebeardednotary.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://thebeardednotary.com/icon.png"}},"dateModified":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","image":"https://thebeardednotary.com/images/notary-pricing-guide-featured.png"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://thebeardednotary.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Rescission Calendar for Notaries","item":"https://thebeardednotary.com/rescission-calendar-for-notaries"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Saturday count as a business day for rescission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Under Regulation Z 1026.2(a)(6), the rescission definition of business day includes all calendar days except Sundays and federal legal holidays. A signing with no holidays in the window that falls on Wednesday ends on Saturday at midnight, not the following Monday."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the signing date count as day one?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The rescission period begins the day after the signing date, or the day after the last of the required disclosures is received if that is later. A Thursday signing makes Friday day one, Saturday day two, and Monday day three, assuming no holidays."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens when a fixed-date holiday like July 4 falls on a weekend?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only the actual legal holiday date is excluded from the count, not an alternate day banks may observe when the holiday falls on a weekend. If July 4 falls on a Saturday, the Friday before it still counts as a business day for rescission purposes, even though many offices are closed that Friday."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a refinance with my current lender have a rescission period?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only partially. If no new money is advanced beyond paying off the existing loan, the refinance is generally exempt under the same-creditor exemption. If the lender advances additional funds, that new-money portion is generally still subject to rescission."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do reverse mortgages have a rescission period?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Generally yes, for a standard HECM reverse mortgage. The exception is an HECM for Purchase transaction, which generally does not have a 3-day right to cancel."}}]}]0:{"buildId":"eGPLLUns6oYj9uMFwKJNZ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-white","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"border-b-4 border-notary-gold bg-notary-navy text-white","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/","className":"text-lg font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-white transition hover:text-notary-gold","children":"THE BEARDED NOTARY"}],["$","$L3",null,{"light":true}]]}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/","className":"mb-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-notary-gold transition hover:text-white","children":"Back to Home"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-sm text-gray-300","children":"Updated September 2026"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold md:text-5xl","children":"Rescission Calendar & Deadline Calculator for Notaries"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$4"}}],"$L5"]}]]}],["$L6"],"$L7"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
5:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg max-w-none","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 font-semibold","children":"The 3-day right of rescission trips up new loan signing agents constantly — not because the rule is complicated, but because it uses a different definition of \"business day\" than everything else in lending. Here's the calculator, and the rules behind it."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600 mb-8","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/ray-bearded-notary-author-photo.jpg","alt":"Ray, founder of The Bearded Notary","className":"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-notary-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Written by"," ",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/about","className":"font-semibold text-notary-navy hover:text-notary-gold hover:underline","children":"Ray"}],", former commissioned California Notary Public (2018-2022) — general notarizations and loan signings."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-800 mb-8","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Disclosure:"}]," This page includes affiliate links. If you buy or sign up through them, The Bearded Notary may earn a commission at no extra cost to you."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6 mb-8","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-800","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Disclaimer:"}]," This is general information and a planning estimate, not legal or compliance advice. The controlling deadline is whatever the borrower's actual Notice of Right to Cancel states. Confirm with the title company or lender before relying on any calculated date, especially around holidays."]}]}],["$","$L8",null,{}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"How the Rescission Period Works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-6","children":"The right of rescission is a consumer protection under Regulation Z (12 CFR 1026.23), enforced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau. It applies to certain refinances and home equity loans secured by the borrower's primary residence. The borrower has until midnight of the third business day to cancel the transaction in writing."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-8","children":"The clock starts the day after the latest of three events: the signing date, the date the borrower receives the Truth in Lending disclosure, and the date the borrower receives the Notice of Right to Cancel. Most of the time, all three happen at the signing table. If the lender sends a corrected disclosure after the signing, the clock restarts from the date that corrected disclosure is received — the original signing date stops being relevant."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"What Counts as a Business Day"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-6","children":"For rescission purposes specifically, Regulation Z's definition of \"business day\" (1026.2(a)(6)) means every calendar day except Sundays and federal legal holidays. That's a narrower exclusion list than the \"business day\" most people assume — Saturdays are included. A Wednesday signing with no holidays in the window ends on Saturday, not the following Monday."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 mb-8 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"The 11 excluded federal holidays"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-1 text-gray-700","children":["$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"]}]]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]
