14:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-8","children":"When a fixed-date holiday lands on a weekend, only the actual legal holiday date is excluded from the count — not whatever alternate day banks close for. If July 4 falls on a Saturday, the Friday before it is still a business day for rescission purposes, even though a lot of offices treat it as a day off. Some lenders take a more conservative approach anyway and treat the observed day as a non-business day too, so confirm with the title company whenever a holiday weekend is involved."}]
15:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"Which Loans Have a Rescission Period"}]
16:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-6","children":"Not every signing triggers rescission. It applies only to certain transactions secured by the borrower's principal dwelling — and a couple of the common categories are more conditional than a flat yes/no."}]
17:["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto mb-8","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full border-collapse border-2 border-gray-300 text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-notary-navy text-white","children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3 text-left","children":"Transaction Type"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3 text-left","children":"Rescission Required?"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":[["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Refinance of primary residence (new lender)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Yes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Home equity loan or HELOC"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Yes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Cash-out refinance on primary residence"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Yes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Refinance with the same lender, no new money advanced"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"No (same-creditor exemption)"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Refinance with the same lender, WITH new money advanced"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Partial — the new-money portion generally is rescindable"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Purchase of any property"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"No"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Investment property or second home"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"No"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Reverse mortgage (HECM)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Yes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"Reverse mortgage for purchase (HECM for Purchase)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"border border-gray-300 p-3","children":"No"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
18:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-8","children":"Not sure whether a package requires it? Look for a Notice of Right to Cancel in the loan documents. If the lender included one, rescission applies. If there isn't one, the loan typically funds the same or next business day."}]
19:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"How a Borrower Actually Rescinds"}]
1a:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-6","children":"The borrower cancels by providing written notice by midnight of the third business day. The notice doesn't need to be received by the lender by the deadline, and it doesn't need to be postmarked by the deadline — it just needs to be sent. If the deadline is midnight Saturday and the borrower drops a cancellation letter in a USPS mailbox at 10pm Saturday, that's a valid rescission even though it won't get postmarked until Monday. Hand-delivery to the lender's office works too, and some loan documents allow electronic notice."}]
1b:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"Common Rescission Mistakes"}]
1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6 mb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-red-900 mb-2","children":"❌ Counting the signing date itself"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"The period starts the day after signing. A Monday signing makes Tuesday day one, not Monday. This is the single most common error, and it shortchanges the borrower's actual cancellation window."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-red-900 mb-2","children":"❌ Excluding Saturdays"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"Saturdays are business days for rescission under Reg Z. A Wednesday signing with no holidays in the window ends Saturday — period, not the following Monday."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-red-900 mb-2","children":"❌ Ignoring a corrected disclosure"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"If the lender mails a corrected disclosure after the signing, the clock restarts from the date the borrower receives that corrected disclosure. The original signing date becomes irrelevant."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-red-900 mb-2","children":"❌ Forgetting the window can span a holiday"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"A signing that would normally clear in three calendar days can stretch to four or five when a federal holiday falls in the window — Thanksgiving and Christmas week are where this catches people off guard most often."}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-notary-navy mt-12 mb-6","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]
1e:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6 mb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-3","children":"Does Saturday count as a business day for rescission?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"Yes. Regulation Z's rescission-specific definition of business day includes all calendar days except Sundays and federal legal holidays. A Wednesday signing with no holidays in between ends Saturday at midnight."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-3","children":"Does the signing date count as day one?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"No. The period begins the day after the signing date (or the day after the last required disclosure is delivered, if later). A Thursday signing makes Friday day one, Saturday day two, and Monday day three, assuming no holidays — the loan funds Tuesday."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-3","children":"What happens when a holiday falls on a weekend?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"Only the actual legal holiday date is excluded. An alternate day banks observe when the holiday falls on a weekend is still a business day for rescission counting. Some lenders are more conservative about this, so confirm with the title company when a holiday weekend is involved."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-3","children":"Which loans don't have a rescission period?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"Purchase loans, investment property or second-home loans, same-lender refinances with no new money, and HECM-for-Purchase reverse mortgages generally don't have one. If there's no Notice of Right to Cancel in the package, the loan typically doesn't have rescission."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-3","children":"Can a borrower rescind after the three-day period?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"Generally no. If the lender failed to provide the required disclosures or the Notice of Right to Cancel, the rescission period may extend up to three years under certain circumstances — that's a question for the borrower's attorney, not something to estimate here."}]]}]]}]
